{"version":1,"content":"<p>以色列周二（27日）舉行國會大選，左翼政黨民主黨黨魁戈蘭（Yair Golan）在特拉維夫拉票期間，遭一名持刀男子靠近威脅，該男子隨即被捕。</p><p>民主黨形容這是一宗企圖持刀襲擊案。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T13:21:51.995671+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":88,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T13:00:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T09:58:20.107700+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T13:18:20.551036+00:00","content_hash":"8ec2f584d588ba7a47a0ecb2b8c12f47b885b5d8719c456630c867834798fab6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}